<title>USA: Bear Stearns ups Workingmen's stake.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns ups Workingmen's stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc said Monday it raised its stake in Workingmen's Capital Holdings Inc to 8.0 percent or 144,385 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bear Stearns said it bought 52,500 additional shares of Workingmen's between August 6 and September 6 at prices ranaing from $21.00 to $21.3125 a share.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns is the brokerage unit of investment bank Bear Stearns Cos Inc.</p>
